    {
      "level": "h2",
      "heading": "Introduction to Probability",
      "html": "<ul node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding-left: 20px;\">\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">Probability is the study of chance or the likelihood of an event happening</li>\n</ul><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>Number&nbsp;of&nbsp;favourable&nbsp;outcomes</mtext><mtext>Total&nbsp;number&nbsp;of&nbsp;outcomes</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n  P(event) = \\frac{\\text{Number of favourable outcomes}}{\\text{Total number of outcomes}}\n  </annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.03588em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 2.0574em; vertical-align: -0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height: 1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top: -2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: 3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Total&nbsp;number&nbsp;of&nbsp;outcomes</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top: -3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: 3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top: -3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: 3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Number&nbsp;of&nbsp;favourable&nbsp;outcomes</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height: 0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span><ul node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding-left: 20px;\">\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">\n<p>If probability = 0, the event is impossible</p>\n</li>\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">\n<p>If probability =1, the event is certain to happen</p>\n</li>\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">\n<p>If probability = 0.5, there is an even chance</p>\n</li>\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">\n<p>All probabilities lie between 0 and 1</p>\n</li>\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">\n<p>Probability can be written in</p>\n<ul node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding-left: 20px;\">\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">\n<p>Fraction</p>\n</li>\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">\n<p>Decimal</p>\n</li>\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">\n<p>Percentage</p>\n<p><img alt=\"G E M F 5 A - ELEVISE\" src=\"https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcTV1b7c3SwTm1IEEwMCmo_cMbGpphkWbPSj9g&amp;s\"></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">\n<p><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(A) = 1 - P(A')</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 0.7278em; vertical-align: -0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 1.0019em; vertical-align: -0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height: 0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top: -3.063em; margin-right: 0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: 2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">\n<p><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Probability&nbsp;of&nbsp;A&nbsp;happening</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mtext>Probability&nbsp;of&nbsp;A&nbsp;Not&nbsp;Happening</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Probability of A happening} = 1 - \\text{Probability of A Not Happening}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 0.8889em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Probability&nbsp;of&nbsp;A&nbsp;happening</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 0.7278em; vertical-align: -0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 0.8889em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Probability&nbsp;of&nbsp;A&nbsp;Not&nbsp;Happening</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>"
    },
    {
      "level": "h2",
      "heading": "Events",
      "html": ""
    },
    {
      "level": "h3",
      "heading": "Exclusive Events",
      "html": "<ul node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding-left: 20px;\">\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">Two events are exclusive if they cannot occur at the same time<br>\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://images.znotes.org/cie/igcse/maths-0580/image064.png\"></li>\n</ul><p>Probabilities of any choice of events</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://images.znotes.org/allimages/a290d8c02556a1b6d62f7b78.webp\"></p>"
    },
    {
      "level": "h3",
      "heading": "Independent Events",
      "html": "<ul node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding-left: 20px;\">\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">Two events are independent if the occurrence of one is unaffected by\noccurrence of other</li>\n</ul>"
    },
    {
      "level": "h3",
      "heading": "The OR Rule",
      "html": "<ul node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding-left: 20px;\">\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">\n<p>Refers to the probability of either event happening (or both)</p>\n</li>\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">\n<p><strong>Rule:</strong> <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mtext>&nbsp;or&nbsp;</mtext><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(A \\text{ or } B) = P(A) + P(B) - P(A \\cap B)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">&nbsp;or&nbsp;</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.05017em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.05017em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.05017em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">\n<p>If events are mutually exclusive:</p>\n<ul node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding-left: 20px;\">\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mtext>&nbsp;or&nbsp;</mtext><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(A \\text{ or } B) = P(A) + P(B)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">&nbsp;or&nbsp;</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.05017em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.05017em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>"
    },
    {
      "level": "h3",
      "heading": "The AND Rule",
      "html": "<ul node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding-left: 20px;\">\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">Refers to the probability of two events happening together.</li>\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\"><strong>Rule:</strong> <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mtext>&nbsp;and&nbsp;</mtext><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(A \\text{ and } B) = P(A \\cap B)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">&nbsp;and&nbsp;</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.05017em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.05017em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></li>\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">If events are independent:\n<ul node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding-left: 20px;\">\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(A \\cap B) = P(A) \\times P(B)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.05017em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.05017em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>"
    },
    {
      "level": "h2",
      "heading": "Conditional Probability",
      "html": "<ul node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding-left: 20px;\">\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">\n<p>Calculate using Venn diagram:</p>\n</li>\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">\n<p>Construct the Venn diagram, using sample space of both events</p>\n<ul node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding-left: 20px;\">\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span>|<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B) = \\frac{P(A \\cap B)}{P(B)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.05017em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 1.53em; vertical-align: -0.52em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height: 1.01em;\"><span style=\"top: -2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: 3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right: 0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right: 0.05017em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top: -3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: 3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top: -3.485em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: 3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right: 0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∩</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right: 0.05017em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height: 0.52em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">\n<p>Calculate using tree diagrams:</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://images.znotes.org/cie/igcse/maths-0580/image066.png\"></p>\n</li>\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">\n<p>First branches = 1st event outcomes</p>\n</li>\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">\n<p>Second branches = 2nd event outcomes</p>\n</li>\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">\n<p>Write probabilities next to each branch</p>\n</li>\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">\n<p>Multiply along branches for combined probabilities</p>\n</li>\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">\n<p>Add if multiple paths lead to the desired outcome</p>\n</li>\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">\n<p>Note: The probabilities reduce with each step if objects are not replaced</p>\n</li>\n</ul><p><strong>Calculate using two-way tables:</strong></p><ul node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding-left: 20px;\">\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">\n<p>Column and row headers are the sample space of the two events</p>\n<ul node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding-left: 20px;\">\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">Fill in each cell with the correct number of outcomes</li>\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">Take the required number from the table and divide by the sum of\nall values in the row/column of the condition provided.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>"
    },
    {
      "level": "h2",
      "heading": "Relative & Expected Frequencies",
      "html": ""
    },
    {
      "level": "h3",
      "heading": "Expected Frequencies",
      "html": "<ul node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding-left: 20px;\">\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">\n<p>This is the number of times we would expect an event to occur over a given number of trials that take place during an experiment</p>\n<p><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Expected&nbsp;Frequency</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>Probability&nbsp;of&nbsp;Event</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>Number&nbsp;of&nbsp;Trials</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Expected Frequency} = \\text{Probability of Event} \\times \\text{Number of Trials}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 0.8889em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Expected&nbsp;Frequency</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 0.8889em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Probability&nbsp;of&nbsp;Event</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Number&nbsp;of&nbsp;Trials</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>"
    },
    {
      "level": "h3",
      "heading": "Relative Frequencies",
      "html": "<ul node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding-left: 20px;\">\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">\n<p>Relative frequency is an estimate of the <strong>probability</strong> of an event based on <strong>experimental (or observed) results</strong> rather than theoretical probability.</p>\n</li>\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">\n<p><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Relative&nbsp;Frequency</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>Number&nbsp;of&nbsp;times&nbsp;event&nbsp;occurs</mtext><mtext>total&nbsp;number&nbsp;of&nbsp;trials</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Relative Frequency} = \\frac{ \\text{Number of times event occurs} }{ \\text{total number of trials} }</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 0.8889em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Relative&nbsp;Frequency</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 1.2251em; vertical-align: -0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height: 0.8801em;\"><span style=\"top: -2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: 3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total&nbsp;number&nbsp;of&nbsp;trials</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top: -3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: 3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top: -3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: 3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Number&nbsp;of&nbsp;times&nbsp;event&nbsp;occurs</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height: 0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">\n<p><strong>Example</strong></p>\n<p>If you toss a coin 100 times and it lands on heads 55 times, the <strong>relative frequency</strong> of getting heads is:\n<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>55</mn><mn>100</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0.55</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{55}{100} = 0.55</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 1.1901em; vertical-align: -0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height: 0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top: -2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: 3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">100</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top: -3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: 3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top: -3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: 3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">55</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height: 0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.55</span></span></span></span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>"
    }
  ]
}